# conditions store snapshot (internal/conditions)
# Built 2026-09-12 from PRE-migration code. The *_user_text rows record what the
# HOLDER is sent: for start and end that is StartUserNotice / EndUserNotice (authored
# line, else the generic fallback, else nothing for a secret condition). A row exists only
# when the sent line is non-empty. authored_start_line is the raw start_user_text of a
# silent-start condition, recorded for every silent-start condition whether or not a site sends it
# today: sleep (15), arrest (88), stun (84) and broken limb (83) have a sender; throttled
# (89) does not, its move narrates the choke itself.
# dimensions: condition id x authored key; source only, conditions never know a target

condition|0|start_user_text => You sit down and begin your meditation.
condition|0|start_room_text => <ansi fg="username">Aliceia</ansi> sits down and begins to meditate.
condition|0|trigger_user_text => You continue your meditation...
condition|0|trigger_room_text => <ansi fg="username">Aliceia</ansi> continues meditating.
condition|0|end_user_text => Your meditation ends and you slip away from the realm.
condition|1|start_user_text => A warm glow surrounds you.
condition|1|start_room_text => A warm glow surrounds Aliceia.
condition|1|end_user_text => Your glow fades away.
condition|1|end_room_text => The glow surrounding Aliceia fades away.
condition|2|start_user_text => <ansi fg="yellow">You are stunned! You cannot attack.</ansi>
condition|2|start_room_text => Aliceia staggers, dazed!
condition|2|end_user_text => <ansi fg="green">You shake off the stun.</ansi>
condition|3|start_user_text => <ansi fg="yellow">Your vision goes dark — you have been blinded!</ansi>
condition|3|start_room_text => Aliceia claws at their eyes, blinded!
condition|3|end_user_text => <ansi fg="green">Your vision slowly returns to normal.</ansi>
condition|5|start_user_text => The compress warms against your skin as the herbs do their work.
condition|5|end_user_text => The poultice's warmth fades.
condition|6|start_user_text => The bitter draught burns going down, then spreads warmth through your legs.
condition|6|trigger_user_text => The draught restores your vigor.
condition|6|end_user_text => The draught's effect fades.
condition|7|start_user_text => The sharp draught clears your thoughts as you swallow it.
condition|7|trigger_user_text => The draught steadies your resolve.
condition|7|end_user_text => The draught's clarity fades.
condition|9|start_user_text => You feel sneaky.
condition|9|start_room_text => Aliceia disappears into the shadows.
condition|9|end_room_text => Aliceia emerges from the shadows.
condition|15|end_user_text => You stir and wake.
condition|15|authored_start_line => You lie down and let sleep take you.
condition|24|start_user_text => You are weak and shaking as you recover from dying.
condition|24|end_user_text => You have recovered from dying and feel steady again.
condition|25|start_user_text => A dark shadow clings to you and dulls your senses.
condition|25|end_user_text => The dark shadow lifts and your senses come back.
condition|26|start_user_text => Conviction surges through your limbs, empowering your strikes.
condition|26|end_user_text => The surge of conviction fades from your limbs.
condition|27|start_user_text => Your mind hardens like iron, resolute and unyielding.
condition|27|end_user_text => The iron resolve in your mind softens back to normal.
condition|28|start_user_text => Chrysalis energy floods your nerves — everything feels faster.
condition|28|end_user_text => The Chrysalis haste fades and your movements return to normal.
condition|29|start_user_text => The dark thins and you make out grey shapes around you.
condition|29|start_room_text => <ansi fg="username">Aliceia</ansi>'s eyes widen and catch the faint light.
condition|29|end_user_text => The dark closes in again and the shapes are gone.
condition|29|end_room_text => The faint light leaves <ansi fg="username">Aliceia</ansi>'s eyes.
condition|30|start_user_text => Your muscles twitch uncontrollably as nerve signals misfire.
condition|30|end_user_text => Your nerves settle and control returns to your limbs.
condition|31|start_user_text => You wrap yourself in a psionic shroud, fading from perception.
condition|31|start_room_text => <ansi fg="username">Aliceia</ansi> seems to shimmer and fade from view.
condition|31|end_room_text => <ansi fg="username">Aliceia</ansi> shimmers back into view.
condition|32|start_user_text => Chrysalis energy suffuses your body with a warm, mending pulse.
condition|32|trigger_user_text => The vital surge mends your wounds.
condition|32|end_user_text => The vital surge fades.
condition|33|start_user_text => Deep Chrysalis energy wraps around you, accelerating your body's healing.
condition|33|trigger_user_text => Chrysalis energy knits your wounds closed.
condition|33|end_user_text => The Chrysalis regeneration fades.
condition|34|start_user_text => Your mind opens and sharpens — every action feels more instructive.
condition|34|end_user_text => The heightened attunement fades from your mind.
condition|35|start_user_text => Chrysalis energy surges through your cells, accelerating mutation.
condition|35|end_user_text => The mutagenic catalyst fades from your system.
condition|36|start_user_text => A psionic anchor locks onto your mind, rooting you in place!
condition|36|end_user_text => The psychic anchor releases its grip on your mind.
condition|37|start_user_text => Your senses explode with input — everything is too bright, too loud!
condition|37|end_user_text => The sensory overload subsides and your senses normalize.
condition|38|start_user_text => Solidified conviction wraps around your body like armor.
condition|38|start_room_text => <ansi fg="username">Aliceia</ansi> is encased in a shimmering layer of conviction.
condition|38|end_user_text => The conviction armor fades from your body.
condition|39|start_user_text => You feel venom seeping into your bloodstream!
condition|39|start_room_text => <ansi fg="username">Aliceia</ansi> winces as venom takes hold.
condition|39|trigger_user_text => Poison burns through your veins.
condition|39|trigger_room_text => <ansi fg="username">Aliceia</ansi> shudders as venom courses through them.
condition|39|end_user_text => The venom finally subsides, leaving you weakened.
condition|40|start_user_text => A cloud of toxic spores engulfs you!
condition|40|start_room_text => <ansi fg="username">Aliceia</ansi> is enveloped in a cloud of choking spores.
condition|40|trigger_user_text => Toxic spores eat at your flesh.
condition|40|trigger_room_text => <ansi fg="username">Aliceia</ansi> winces as fungal toxin spreads.
condition|40|end_user_text => You finally cough up the last of the spores.
condition|41|start_user_text => A thick fog descends over your thoughts...
condition|41|end_user_text => The fog lifts from your mind and clarity returns.
condition|42|start_user_text => The warm meal settles in your belly and your aches ease.
condition|42|end_user_text => The comfort of the meal fades from your belly.
condition|43|start_user_text => The hearty food works through you and your vigour returns.
condition|43|end_user_text => The vigour from the food ebbs away.
condition|44|start_user_text => The drink cools your thoughts and steadies your spirit.
condition|44|end_user_text => The clear feeling in your mind fades.
condition|45|start_user_text => You are full and hale, and it shows in how you stand.
condition|45|end_user_text => You are no longer full, and hunger is not far off.
condition|46|start_user_text => The stiff drink loosens your tongue and steadies your nerve.
condition|46|end_user_text => The liquid courage wears off and you feel shy again.
condition|47|start_user_text => The bitter draught burns your throat but you feel poisons loosening their grip.
condition|47|start_room_text => <ansi fg="username">Aliceia</ansi> grimaces as they swallow an antidote.
condition|47|trigger_user_text => The antidote soothes your body.
condition|47|end_user_text => The antidote has run its course.
condition|48|start_user_text => The tonic sharpens your thoughts to a razor's edge.
condition|48|start_room_text => <ansi fg="username">Aliceia</ansi>'s eyes brighten with renewed focus.
condition|48|end_user_text => The mental clarity fades, leaving your thoughts slightly muddled.
condition|49|start_user_text => A warm tingling spreads through your body as you become more resistant to heat.
condition|49|start_room_text => <ansi fg="username">Aliceia</ansi>'s skin takes on a faint reddish hue.
condition|49|end_user_text => The protective warmth fades from your skin.
condition|50|start_user_text => The poultice floods your body with deep, restorative warmth.
condition|50|start_room_text => <ansi fg="username">Aliceia</ansi> sighs with relief as herbs do their work.
condition|50|trigger_user_text => Healing energy suffuses your body.
condition|50|end_user_text => The deep warmth of the poultice fades away.
condition|51|start_user_text => Raw power surges through your muscles as the elixir takes hold. Your hands tremble with barely contained fury.
condition|51|start_room_text => <ansi fg="username">Aliceia</ansi>'s muscles bulge and veins stand out as a wild look enters their eyes.
condition|51|end_user_text => The berserker rage subsides, leaving you feeling drained but steady.
condition|52|start_user_text => A Chrysalis sheen settles over your skin like a shell.
condition|52|start_room_text => <ansi fg="username">Aliceia</ansi> takes on a faint sheen, like a shell.
condition|52|end_user_text => The Chrysalis sheen flakes away from your skin.
condition|52|end_room_text => The sheen over <ansi fg="username">Aliceia</ansi> flakes away.
condition|53|start_user_text => Your sight pierces the Veil and hidden things show.
condition|53|end_user_text => The Veil closes again and hidden things slip away.
condition|54|start_user_text => Warmth spreads as the salve knits your wounds closed.
condition|54|end_user_text => The warmth of the healing salve fades.
condition|55|start_user_text => Your breath steadies as the tonic surges through you.
condition|55|end_user_text => The tonic wears off and your breath comes hard again.
condition|56|start_user_text => Purpose sharpens your focus as the draught takes hold.
condition|56|end_user_text => The certainty of the draught fades from your mind.
condition|57|start_user_text => Fire spreads in your veins and your aches burn away.
condition|57|end_user_text => The fire cools and your muscles begin to ache again.
condition|58|start_user_text => The Preacher's Tincture settles a calm certainty over you.
condition|58|end_user_text => The calm lifts and your worries settle back in.
condition|59|start_user_text => Your lungs open wide, as if you could run for hours.
condition|59|end_user_text => Your chest tightens and the easy breathing is gone.
condition|60|start_user_text => You feel restored, as if waking from perfect sleep.
condition|60|end_user_text => The renewal fades and you feel your own aches again.
condition|61|start_user_text => Your skin toughens like bark and your joints stiffen.
condition|61|end_user_text => Your skin softens again and your joints move freely.
condition|62|start_user_text => A shell of clarity blunts magic, but your arms feel heavy.
condition|62|end_user_text => The shell of clarity dissolves and your arms lighten.
condition|63|start_user_text => A bitter film blunts spoken power and dulls your senses.
condition|63|end_user_text => The bitter film dissolves and your senses sharpen.
condition|64|start_user_text => Nothing could turn your stomach now, but you feel slow.
condition|64|end_user_text => Your stomach is ordinary again and your reflexes return.
condition|65|start_user_text => The dark recedes and hidden things show, but you feel weak.
condition|65|start_room_text => <ansi fg="username">Aliceia</ansi>'s eyes catch the light like a cat's.
condition|65|end_user_text => The dark closes in, the hidden vanish, your strength returns.
condition|65|end_room_text => The glint fades from <ansi fg="username">Aliceia</ansi>'s eyes.
condition|66|start_user_text => The world slows as your reflexes sharpen, but you tire.
condition|66|end_user_text => The world speeds up again and you feel ordinary.
condition|67|start_user_text => Raw fury floods your muscles and narrows the world.
condition|67|end_user_text => The fury drains away and leaves you spent.
condition|68|start_user_text => Words come easily now, each one landing where you aim.
condition|68|end_user_text => Your words lose their edge and your strength returns.
condition|69|start_user_text => Your senses sharpen and you see each blow coming.
condition|69|end_user_text => The battle trance breaks and the fight blurs again.
condition|70|start_user_text => Your body convulses and expels everything inside you.
condition|70|end_user_text => The convulsions stop and your body is your own.
condition|71|start_user_text => Your body hums with potential and learns as you move.
condition|71|end_user_text => The hum of potential fades from your body.
condition|72|start_user_text => Knowledge settles faster now, and patterns stand out.
condition|72|end_user_text => The infusion wears off and learning feels slow again.
condition|73|start_user_text => Something shifts deep inside you, quiet and certain.
condition|73|end_user_text => The shifting inside you settles and goes still.
condition|74|start_user_text => Chrysalis energy rewrites something deep in your bones.
condition|74|end_user_text => The Chrysalis energy settles and your bones go quiet.
condition|75|start_user_text => Your stomach heaves and your vision swims.
condition|75|end_user_text => The nausea passes and your stomach settles.
condition|76|start_user_text => Everything in you aches in the wake of the purge.
condition|76|end_user_text => The aching from the purge fades away.
condition|77|start_user_text => A searing flash takes your sight and leaves only glare.
condition|77|end_user_text => Your sight clears and shapes come back to you.
condition|78|start_user_text => A cloud of choking fumes engulfs you!
condition|78|start_room_text => <ansi fg="username">Aliceia</ansi> is engulfed in a cloud of toxic fumes.
condition|78|trigger_user_text => The toxic fumes sear your lungs.
condition|78|end_user_text => The toxic cloud finally dissipates.
condition|79|end_user_text => The fervor of the warcry fades from you.
condition|80|end_user_text => The strength of the rally drains from you.
condition|82|start_user_text => Your hands go perfectly still and every motion is exact.
condition|82|end_user_text => A faint tremor returns to your hands.
condition|83|end_user_text => <ansi fg="green">The ache in your limb finally fades. You can move at full strength again.</ansi>
condition|83|authored_start_line => <ansi fg="red">You feel the wrench of a broken limb. Sharp pain will follow every motion until it heals.</ansi>
condition|84|end_user_text => <ansi fg="green">You shake off the stun and regain your composure.</ansi>
condition|84|authored_start_line => <ansi fg="red">The submission's pressure leaves you stunned, unable to react.</ansi>
condition|86|start_user_text => You commit the trail to memory and steady your senses.
condition|86|end_user_text => Your focus on the trail breaks.
condition|87|start_user_text => You fall into your quarry's wake, footfalls silenced to match theirs.
condition|87|end_user_text => Your focus on the quarry breaks.
condition|88|end_user_text => The cell door swings open. You are free to go.
condition|88|authored_start_line => The cell door clangs shut behind you. You are held here until your sentence is served or your fine is paid.
condition|89|end_user_text => The grip releases and you gasp air into your chest.
condition|89|authored_start_line => A grip closes on your throat and crushes your breath.
condition|90|start_user_text => The world falls away. A slow warmth floods from your center outward -- every ache dissolves, every edge softens. You feel capable of anything.
condition|90|end_user_text => The warmth recedes, leaving a hollow ache in its wake. The world feels harder-edged than it did before.
condition|91|start_user_text => The communion ends. Your body feels suddenly heavy, your thoughts thick and gray. You are left with the crash.
condition|91|end_user_text => The worst of the crash passes, though you still feel wrung out.
condition|92|start_user_text => The need for Bloom rises like a tide -- your hands shake, your mouth is dry, and your thoughts keep circling back to the wafer and its warmth.
condition|92|end_user_text => The craving subsides, for now.
condition|93|end_user_text => The worst of the purge passes. You are wrung out and hollow, but the Bloom's grip on you has slipped.
condition|94|start_user_text => The air over the buried surface crawls, and a cold shock jolts up through you.
condition|94|start_room_text => <ansi fg="username">Aliceia</ansi> jerks as the ground arcs against them.
condition|94|trigger_user_text => A cold arc bites up through you.
condition|94|trigger_room_text => <ansi fg="username">Aliceia</ansi> shudders as the ground arcs against them.
condition|94|end_user_text => The stinging in your bones fades — for now.
condition|95|start_user_text => The buried place presses your gift down and holds it.
condition|95|end_user_text => The pressure lifts and your gift stirs awake again.
condition|96|start_user_text => The dead metal wakes just enough to hate you, and a hard arc slams up through your bones.
condition|96|start_room_text => <ansi fg="username">Aliceia</ansi> convulses as the dead metal arcs against them.
condition|96|trigger_user_text => A savage arc bites up through you.
condition|96|trigger_room_text => <ansi fg="username">Aliceia</ansi> shudders as the dead metal arcs against them.
condition|96|end_user_text => The arcing fades — for now.
condition|97|start_user_text => Something you crossed was still armed. A ward discharges in a white lash and the pain arrives a half-beat later.
condition|97|start_room_text => <ansi fg="username">Aliceia</ansi> trips a dormant ward and the corridor flares white.
condition|97|trigger_user_text => The ward's charge crawls through you again.
condition|97|trigger_room_text => <ansi fg="username">Aliceia</ansi> spasms as the ward's charge finds them.
condition|97|end_user_text => The seared feeling dulls.
condition|98|start_user_text => The treads pulse — the world slows around your stride.
condition|98|end_user_text => Your stride settles back to mortal pace.
condition|100|start_user_text => The world goes red. Something in you comes off its chain.
condition|100|start_room_text => <ansi fg="username">Aliceia</ansi>'s eyes go wide and bloodshot, and a low snarl builds in their throat.
condition|100|end_user_text => The red haze recedes, and your limbs sag with the ebb of it.
condition|101|start_user_text => You stand a little taller — someone at your side is worth following.
condition|101|end_user_text => The steadying presence fades, and the fight feels lonelier.
condition|102|start_user_text => A grinding dissonance fills your skull and your aim wanders.
condition|102|start_room_text => <ansi fg="username">Aliceia</ansi> shudders as a grinding resonance sets their teeth on edge.
condition|102|end_user_text => The dissonance fades and your aim steadies.
condition|102|end_room_text => The dissonance around <ansi fg="username">Aliceia</ansi> fades.
condition|103|start_user_text => You flex, and a slick sheen of venom weeps across your weapons. Every blow will bite deeper now.
condition|103|end_user_text => The last of the venom dries and flakes away from your weapons.
condition|104|start_user_text => You fold inward and a hard, translucent shell snaps shut around you. The world's blows dull to distant taps.
condition|104|end_user_text => Your shell splits and sloughs away, and the world rushes back in.
condition|105|start_user_text => You feel your bond-master's will surge through you.
condition|105|end_user_text => The bond's strength ebbs away.
condition|106|start_user_text => Molten backlash splashes across you and clings, searing!
condition|106|start_room_text => Aliceia recoils, skin blistering with molten backlash.
condition|106|trigger_user_text => The clinging heat burns deeper.
condition|106|trigger_room_text => Aliceia grimaces as the molten residue burns on.
condition|106|end_user_text => The searing heat finally fades from your skin.
condition|107|start_user_text => Numbing frost creeps into your limbs, stiffening them.
condition|107|start_room_text => Aliceia stiffens as frost bites into their limbs.
condition|107|end_user_text => Warmth returns and the frost releases your limbs.
condition|108|start_user_text => A jolt snaps through you, scrambling your nerves.
condition|108|start_room_text => Aliceia jerks as a charge arcs through them.
condition|108|end_user_text => The buzzing charge drains away and your nerves settle.
condition|109|start_user_text => Your blow rebounds off a skin of telekinetic force, and you stagger!
condition|109|start_room_text => Aliceia staggers as their own blow rebounds on them.
condition|109|end_user_text => You recover your footing.
condition|110|start_user_text => Clinging residue smears across you, dragging at every move.
condition|110|start_room_text => Aliceia flounders, limbs fouled with clinging residue.
condition|110|end_user_text => The clinging residue finally flakes away.
condition|111|start_user_text => Barbed tendrils erupt and coil around your limbs, rooting you fast!
condition|111|start_room_text => Aliceia is snared by a mass of barbed, writhing tendrils.
condition|111|end_user_text => The tendrils wither and release their grip.
condition|112|start_user_text => Silk and dissonance drag at your limbs and your focus.
condition|112|start_room_text => Aliceia slows, snared and reeling in a smothering field of silk and dissonance.
condition|112|end_user_text => The field thins and your limbs move freely again.
condition|112|end_room_text => The smothering field around <ansi fg="username">Aliceia</ansi> thins and lifts.
condition|113|start_user_text => A radiant presence blazes at your side — you feel lifted beyond yourself.
condition|113|end_user_text => The radiant presence dims, and you settle back into yourself.
condition|114|start_user_text => A cold, watching malice settles over you — your aim wavers and your guard sags.
condition|114|start_room_text => Aliceia falters under an unseen, baleful gaze.
condition|114|end_user_text => The watching malice lifts, and your focus returns.
condition|115|start_user_text => Ragged claw-wounds tear open across you, bleeding freely!
condition|115|start_room_text => Aliceia is raked open, blood welling from ragged claw-wounds.
condition|115|trigger_user_text => Your torn wounds keep bleeding.
condition|115|end_user_text => The bleeding finally slows and clots.
condition|116|start_user_text => A primal dread rolls over you and every instinct says run.
condition|116|start_room_text => Aliceia shrinks back, gripped by a sudden animal dread.
condition|116|end_user_text => The dread loosens its grip on you.
condition|116|end_room_text => The dread gripping <ansi fg="username">Aliceia</ansi> loosens.
condition|119|end_user_text => Your Minor Shield dissipates.
condition|119|end_room_text => <ansi fg="username">Aliceia</ansi>'s Minor Shield dissipates.
condition|120|end_user_text => The healing magic in your wounds runs its course.
condition|121|trigger_user_text => <ansi fg="green">The poison burns through your veins!</ansi>
condition|121|end_user_text => The poison in your veins finally burns itself out.
condition|122|trigger_user_text => <ansi fg="red">Blood seeps from your wounds!</ansi>
condition|122|end_user_text => Your wounds stop bleeding.
condition|123|start_user_text => The severed bond leaves a hollow in you that will take time to fill.
condition|123|end_user_text => The hollow the severed bond left in you has finally closed.
